      <li><a href="https://jmlr.org/papers/v15/hoffman14a.html">Hoffman &amp; Gelman (2014), The No-U-Turn Sampler</a>: original derivation, candidate-set conditions and Algorithms 2, 3 and 6. Our inspectable code uses Algorithm 2 with a fixed depth cap, not a mixture of the later selection rules.</li>
